 Kita pergi belok.

1222
00:52:45,000 --> 00:52:46,000
 Bagaimana?

1223
00:52:47,000 --> 00:52:49,000
 Lembok.

1224
00:52:49,000 --> 00:52:52,000
 Kita kata, kita biar nak pelepah juga.

1225
00:52:52,000 --> 00:52:54,000
 Soal pelepah, air ini nak belok.

1226
00:52:54,000 --> 00:52:55,000
 Lembok dulu ya.

1227
00:52:56,000 --> 00:52:57,000
 Pelerembok.

1228
00:52:57,000 --> 00:52:59,000
 Itu macam macam nak memberi kesang kepada palung.

1229
00:52:59,000 --> 00:53:01,000
 Itu mungkin dia pecah ke?

1230
00:53:01,000 --> 00:53:02,000
 Jadi macam macam nak.

1231
00:53:03,000 --> 00:53:06,000
 Kita pergi belok darah atau patut keluar.

1232
00:53:06,000 --> 00:53:08,000
 Ada kesangnya.

1233
00:53:08,000 --> 00:53:10,000
 Mesti ada kesang.

1234
00:53:10,000 --> 00:53:11,000
 Sikit atau banyak.

1235
00:53:11,000 --> 00:53:12,000
 Sikit.

1236
00:53:12,000 --> 00:53:13,000
 Sekiranya sikit banyak-banyak.

1237
00:53:13,000 --> 00:53:15,000
 Berta kita memutuhkan badan kita balik.

1238
00:53:15,000 --> 00:53:17,000
 Tapi kalau kita ikut, tak apalah.

1239
00:53:17,000 --> 00:53:18,000
 Dia nak pergi ke mahia lah.

1240
00:53:18,000 --> 00:53:20,000
 Dia pergi makan sayang.

1241
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:22,000
 Saya pergi makan kota semua sayang.

1242
00:53:22,000 --> 00:53:23,000
 Tuhah lagi.

1243
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:25,000
 Mungkin anak semua sayang.

1244
00:53:25,000 --> 00:53:26,000
 Dia tak nak pergi.

1245
00:53:26,000 --> 00:53:27,000
 Itu tak apa-apa.

1246
00:53:27,000 --> 00:53:28,000
 Saya tengoklah.

1247
00:53:28,000 --> 00:53:29,000
 Tak apa-apalah.

1248
00:53:29,000 --> 00:53:31,000
 InsyaAllah boleh pahala sama.

1249
00:53:31,000 --> 00:53:33,000
 Tapi kita tak mikir ada kita.

1250
00:53:34,000 --> 00:53:37,000
 Kita mikir cara matematik kita.

1251
00:53:37,000 --> 00:53:38,000
 Boleh sayang.

1252
00:53:38,000 --> 00:53:39,000
 Kita kumpul duit.

1253
00:53:39,000 --> 00:53:41,000
 Soal sayang, saya nak kumpul.

1254
00:53:41,000 --> 00:53:42,000
 Dapat tujuh ribu-ribu maka.

1255
00:53:42,000 --> 00:53:43,000
 Maka kita tak boleh.

1256
00:53:43,000 --> 00:53:44,000
 Sayang sayang.

1257
00:53:44,000 --> 00:53:45,000
 Sayang.

1258
00:53:45,000 --> 00:53:46,000
 Kita pulang.

1259
00:53:47,000 --> 00:53:48,000
 Sayang emosi kita.

1260
00:53:48,000 --> 00:53:51,000
 Jadi ada sayang kepada perempuan kita.

1261
00:53:52,000 --> 00:53:53,000
 Allah nak beri ke mana?

1262
00:53:54,000 --> 00:53:56,000
 Ini cuti Tuhan beri.

1263
00:53:56,000 --> 00:53:57,000
 Dia aku.

1264
00:53:57,000 --> 00:53:58,000
 Dia kuas mahayang.

1265
00:53:58,000 --> 00:54:00,000
 Kita tak usah marahit.

1266
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:01,000
 Kenapa kamu marahit?

1267
00:54:01,000 --> 00:54:02,000
 10 hari.

1268
00:54:02,000 --> 00:54:03,000
 Sayang, dia nak ke mahayang.

1269
00:54:04,000 --> 00:54:05,000
 Tuhan nak beri cuti.

1270
00:54:05,000 --> 00:54:07,000
 Semua tak boleh cuti.

1271
00:54:07,000 --> 00:54:08,000
 Kalau Tuhan tak beri.

1272
00:54:08,000 --> 00:54:09,000
 Memitau.

1273
00:54:10,000 --> 00:54:11,000
 Kita kerja.

1274
00:54:11,000 --> 00:54:12,000
 Memitau cuti.

1275
00:54:13,000 --> 00:54:14,000
 Nak rehat.

1276
00:54:14,000 --> 00:54:16,000
 Suka kajang umur cuti.

1277
00:54:16,000 --> 00:54:17,000
 Nihak tuan beri cuti.

1278
00:54:17,000 --> 00:54:18,000
 Tak beri cuti.

1279
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:22,000
 Kita tak boleh mikir dengan emosi dan akal kita.

1280
00:54:22,000 --> 00:54:25,000
 Kita kena mikir cara yang Tuhan tunjuk kepada kita.

1281
00:54:26,000 --> 00:54:28,000
 Allah beri ke mana?

1282
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:30,000
 Dia kerja mengira.

1283
00:54:30,000 --> 00:54:31,000
 Padahal kerja kita.

1284
00:54:31,000 --> 00:54:32,000
 Kita buat.

1285
00:54:32,000 --> 00:54:33,000
 Tak boleh.

1286
00:54:33,000 --> 00:54:34,000
 Tak marahit.

1287
00:54:34,000 --> 00:54:35,000
 Jangan.

1288
00:54:35,000 --> 00:54:37,000
 Aisyah R.A.T.

1289
00:54:38,000 --> 00:54:39,000
 R.A.T.

1290
00:54:40,000 --> 00:54:41,000
 Dia marahit.

1291
00:54:43,000 --> 00:54:44,000
 Jadi bila marahit.

1292
00:54:44,000 --> 00:54:46,000
 Tapi kata-kata dia buat lah pun.

1293
00:54:46,000 --> 00:54:47,000
 Mereka boleh buat kecuali.

1294
00:54:47,000 --> 00:54:48,000
 Jangan tawar.

1295
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:51,000
 Tawar dia tunggu marahit bersih.

1296
00:54:51,000 --> 00:54:52,000
 Mereka boleh tawar.

1297
00:54:52,000 --> 00:54:54,000
 Masjid Haram tu di Kambah tu.

1298
00:54:54,000 --> 00:54:55,000
 Maknanya

1299
00:54:56,000 --> 00:54:58,000
 Aisyah tu ikut macam biasa lah.

1300
00:54:58,000 --> 00:55:00,000
 Dan marahit itu anda.

1301
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:02,000
 Jadi dalam bagi banda.

1302
00:55:02,000 --> 00:55:04,000
 Kita kena paham itu.

1303
00:55:04,000 --> 00:55:05,000
 Penyiraan.

1304
00:55:05,000 --> 00:55:07,000
 Agamanya macam tu.

1305
00:55:07,000 --> 00:55:09,000
 Kata Abu Isa dan pada Pak ini.

1306
00:55:09,000 --> 00:55:12,000
 Ada diwayak daripada Abdullah Ibu Umar.

1307
00:55:12,000 --> 00:55:13,000
 Dan Anas.

1308
00:55:13,000 --> 00:55:15,000
 Dan Asaib.

1309
00:55:15,000 --> 00:55:17,000
 Kata Abu Isa lagi.

1310
00:55:17,000 --> 00:55:20,000
 Bermula habis Imran bihusah ini.

1311
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:22,000
 Ialah habis hasil lagi sahen.

1312
00:55:22,000 --> 00:55:24,000
 Dan sesungguhnya diriwayakkan ini habis.

1313
00:55:24,000 --> 00:55:26,000
 Dengan satu isnah lain katanya.

1314
00:55:26,000 --> 00:55:29,000
 An Imrana Ibn Hussainiqala.

1315
00:55:29,000 --> 00:55:31,000
 Berti ada satu lagi diriwayak.

1316
00:55:31,000 --> 00:55:32,000
 Imran juga.

1317
00:55:32,000 --> 00:55:35,000
 Saat tu Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam

1318
00:55:35,000 --> 00:55:36,000
 Ansara Tilmaril.

1319
00:55:36,000 --> 00:55:39,000
 Aku tanya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam

1320
00:55:39,000 --> 00:55:41,000
 Sallallahu alaihi wasallam orang sakit.

1321
00:55:41,000 --> 00:55:42,000
 Sallallahu alaihi wasallam.

1322
00:55:42,000 --> 00:55:44,000
 Sallallahu alaihi wasallam samaiam diri.

1323
00:55:44,000 --> 00:55:47,000
 Fa'alam ta satiq faqa'idah.

1324
00:55:47,000 --> 00:55:49,000
 Sekiranya tidak boleh maka duduk.

1325
00:55:49,000 --> 00:55:52,000
 Fa'alam ta satiq faqala jambin.

1326
00:55:52,000 --> 00:55:54,000
 Maka jika tak boleh juga.

1327
00:55:54,000 --> 00:55:56,000
 Maka dengan cara berbaring.

1328
00:55:57,000 --> 00:56:00,000
 Dia habis ni kenapa perawanya Imran?

1329
00:56:01,000 --> 00:56:04,000
 Imran ni seorang sahabat Nabi.

1330
00:56:04,000 --> 00:56:05,000
 Yang banyak.

1331
00:56:05,000 --> 00:56:07,000
 Mediwayakkan hadiri Nabi.

1332
00:56:07,000 --> 00:56:09,000
 Sebab dia banyak mendampingnya Nabi.

1333
00:56:10,000 --> 00:56:12,000
 Hati bak sakit ni.

1334
00:56:12,000 --> 00:56:13,000
 Sebab dia sakit.

1335
00:56:13,000 --> 00:56:15,000
 Dia kena buasai tadi.

1336
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:17,000
 Dia kena buasai main uzu dia.

1337
00:56:17,000 --> 00:56:20,000
 Maka ditanya Nabi tentang sallalawak sakit.

1338
00:56:20,000 --> 00:56:23,000
 Ada tanya Nabi tentang sallalawak berdiri dengan duduk.

1339
00:56:23,000 --> 00:56:24,000
 Untuk cerita Imran.

1340
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:25,000
 Baik.

1341
00:56:25,000 --> 00:56:28,000
 Dan telah dia keluarkan oleh Imam Bukodin.

1342
00:56:28,000 --> 00:56:29,000
 Akhirkan hari ini.

1343
00:56:29,000 --> 00:56:34,000
 Dalam sahayahnya dalam bak sallalawak ini dan bak sallalawak orang yang duduk.

1344
00:56:34,000 --> 00:56:35,000
 Masalah.

1345
00:56:35,000 --> 00:56:37,000
 Dan ni sekarang kita bahas.

1346
00:56:38,000 --> 00:56:41,000
 Semayang duduk adakah bahalanya.

1347
00:56:41,000 --> 00:56:42,000
 Wahaii surat saya.

1348
00:56:42,000 --> 00:56:44,000
 Dengan haris yang dalam masalah itu.

1349
00:56:44,000 --> 00:56:48,000
 Kita ketahui lah dapat bahalanya bagi orang yang semayang duduk.

1350
00:56:49,000 --> 00:56:52,000
 Kata Imam Lawawi dalam syarat muslim bawah sana.

1351
00:56:52,000 --> 00:56:54,000
 Semayang duduk itu pada baris tengah.

1352
00:56:55,000 --> 00:56:57,000
 Seperti dua baris semayang berdiri.

1353
00:56:57,000 --> 00:57:00,000
 Maka mengandunglah ia atas suas sembayang.

1354
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:01,000
 Serta kurang bahalanya.

1355
00:57:01,000 --> 00:57:05,000
 Dan bermula hari ini ditanggungkan dia atas semayang.

1356
00:57:05,000 --> 00:57:08,000
 Dulu duduk serta kuasa atau berdiri.

1357
00:57:08,000 --> 00:57:11,000
 Maka inilah baginya bahalanya setengah bahalanya semayang berdiri.

1358
00:57:11,000 --> 00:57:14,000
 Ada pun apabila semayang akan semayang sunak.

1359
00:57:14,000 --> 00:57:15,000
 Hal kadang duduk.

1360
00:57:15,000 --> 00:57:17,000
 Karena lemahnya daripada berdiri.

1361
00:57:17,000 --> 00:57:19,000
 Maka tiada kurang bahalanya.

1362
00:57:19,000 --> 00:57:22,000
 Bahkan adalah bahalanya seperti bahalanya berdiri juga.

1363
00:57:23,000 --> 00:57:26,000
 Jadi yang Imam Lawawi sebut ini macam saya hurat tadi lah.

1364
00:57:26,000 --> 00:57:28,000
 Menuju kepada salah yang sunak.

1365
00:57:28,000 --> 00:57:29,000
 Boleh separuh.

1366
00:57:29,000 --> 00:57:33,000
 Tapi kalau apa namanya dia duduk.

1367
00:57:33,000 --> 00:57:35,000
 Karena sebab huzur dia.

1368
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:38,000
 Dia nak berdiri juga.

1369
00:57:38,000 --> 00:57:40,000
 Maka Allah punya pahala sahabat.

1370
00:57:40,000 --> 00:57:42,000
 Baik. Masalah.

1371
00:57:42,000 --> 00:57:45,000
 Salah Fardu bolehkah duduk?

1372
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:48,000
 Bila kita boleh duduk untuk salah Fardu?

1373
00:57:48,000 --> 00:57:50,000
 Katik Manaawirah syarat muslim.

1374
00:57:50,000 --> 00:57:53,000
 Dan ada pun bermula salah Fardu.

1375
00:57:53,000 --> 00:57:56,000
 Maka bahawasannya, sembayangnya, hal kadang duduk.

1376
00:57:56,000 --> 00:57:58,000
 Serta kuasa nya atau berdiri.

1377
00:57:58,000 --> 00:58:00,000
 Masaya teresah.

1378
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:01,000
 Salahnya.

1379
00:58:01,000 --> 00:58:04,000
 Dan tiada bagi pahala, bahkan berdosi.

1380
00:58:04,000 --> 00:58:06,000
 Sebab apa? Sebab dirupun.

1381
00:58:06,000 --> 00:58:09,000
 Dan jika sembayang Fardu, hal kadang duduk.

1382
00:58:09,000 --> 00:58:11,000
 Karena lemuhnya daripada berdiri.

1383
00:58:11,000 --> 00:58:13,000
 Atau menyengeng.

1384
00:58:13,000 --> 00:58:14,000
 Mengirim tidur.

1385
00:58:14,000 --> 00:58:16,000
 Karena lemuhnya daripada berdiri.

1386
00:58:16,000 --> 00:58:17,000
 Dan duduk.

1387
00:58:17,000 --> 00:58:19,000
 Maka pahalanya seperti pahala berdiri dengan dia.

1388
00:58:19,000 --> 00:58:22,000
 Tiada kurang, dengan tifat asap kita.

1389
00:58:22,000 --> 00:58:24,000
 Ini pendapat masyarak kita siap ini.

1390
00:58:24,000 --> 00:58:26,000
 Maka tak yin lah.

1391
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:29,000
 Tanggungan hari separah memperbahagi dua akan pahala.

1392
00:58:29,000 --> 00:58:31,000
 Itu adalah atas mereka yang sembayang sunak.

1393
00:58:31,000 --> 00:58:33,000
 Hal kadang duduk.

1394
00:58:33,000 --> 00:58:35,000
 Serta kuasa nya atau berdiri.

1395
00:58:35,000 --> 00:58:37,000
 Ialah tafsir masak kita.

1396
00:58:37,000 --> 00:58:39,000
 Dan dengan dia lah.

1397
00:58:39,000 --> 00:58:42,000
 Berkata jumhu pada tafsir ini hadis.

1398
00:58:42,000 --> 00:58:44,000
 Maksudnya jumhu ulama.

1399
00:58:44,000 --> 00:58:46,000
 Merujuk hadis ini pada cerita.

1400
00:58:46,000 --> 00:58:48,000
 Pak Sunnah.

1401
00:58:48,000 --> 00:58:50,000
 Bediri boleh nak duduk.

1402
00:58:50,000 --> 00:58:52,000
 Boleh pada separuh.

1403
00:58:52,000 --> 00:58:55,000
 Tapi kalau soalan Fardu, dia berdiri.

1404
00:58:55,000 --> 00:58:57,000
 Tapi tak boleh beri di duduk.

1405
00:58:57,000 --> 00:59:00,000
 Dan setelah menghikaya akan ada al-qadr iya.

1406
00:59:00,000 --> 00:59:01,000
 Dari boleh satu jamas.

1407
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:03,000
 Tengah daripada mereka itu al-Tauri.

1408
00:59:03,000 --> 00:59:05,000
 Dan Ibnul Manishun.

1409
00:59:05,000 --> 00:59:08,000
 Dihikayakan daripada al-Baji.

1410
00:59:08,000 --> 00:59:10,000
 Setengah daripada Imam Mazad Maniki.

1411
00:59:10,000 --> 00:59:11,000
 Bahwasanya.

1412
00:59:11,000 --> 00:59:14,000
 Menangung iya akan di atas orang yang sembayang Fardu.

1413
00:59:14,000 --> 00:59:16,000
 Kerana uzo.

1414
00:59:16,000 --> 00:59:17,000
 Atas sembayang sunak.

1415
00:59:17,000 --> 00:59:18,000
 Kanu uzo.

1416
00:59:18,000 --> 00:59:19,000
 Atau ketidang uzo.

1417
00:59:19,000 --> 00:59:22,000
 Mengharus iya akan selak duduk pada sembayang Fardu.

1418
00:59:22,000 --> 00:59:25,000
 Dan sunak pada hal mungkin iya berdiri.

1419
00:59:25,000 --> 00:59:26,000
 Dengan masyarakat.

1420
00:59:26,000 --> 00:59:27,000
 Baik.

1421
00:59:28,000 --> 00:59:31,000
 Jadi dalam Mak Solah.

1422
00:59:31,000 --> 00:59:36,000
 Kalau kita rasa malah sangat.

1423
00:59:36,000 --> 00:59:37,000
 Naim malah.

1424
00:59:37,000 --> 00:59:39,000
 Tak apa lah duduk.

1425
00:59:39,000 --> 00:59:40,000
 Tak malah.

1426
00:59:40,000 --> 00:59:42,000
 Kita boleh pahala ya.

1427
00:59:42,000 --> 00:59:44,000
 Bulan Ramadha.

1428
00:59:44,000 --> 00:59:46,000
 Kita solak sunak.

1429
00:59:46,000 --> 00:59:50,000
 Biasa kita buat lapar japur tiga solah.

1430
00:59:50,000 --> 00:59:52,000
 Ada orang buat dua bulu.

1431
00:59:52,000 --> 00:59:56,000
 Terkata tak larak dua bulu panjang.

1432
00:59:59,000 --> 01:00:02,000
 Kalau kita kekalkan berdepah, tunggu dua bulu pun.

1433
01:00:02,000 --> 01:00:05,000
 Tapi kita duduk tak apa.

1434
01:00:05,000 --> 01:00:07,000
 Imam, macam biasa.

1435
01:00:07,000 --> 01:00:09,000
 Kita berdiri panjang Imam kali ini.

1436
01:00:09,000 --> 01:00:11,000
 Kamu penat dah berdiri.

1437
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:12,000
 Duduk.

1438
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:14,000
 Duduk tu Imam tak habis lagi.

1439
01:00:14,000 --> 01:00:15,000
 Pupanjang tu Imam.

1440
01:00:15,000 --> 01:00:16,000
 Dengar obrik duduk.

1441
01:00:16,000 --> 01:00:18,000
 Langsung nak berdiri.

1442
01:00:18,000 --> 01:00:20,000
 Diri tak habis lagi juga.

1443
01:00:20,000 --> 01:00:22,000
 Duduk duduk.

1444
01:00:22,000 --> 01:00:24,000
 Boleh kena ulit?

1445
01:00:24,000 --> 01:00:25,000
 Punggung tanya. Buas dia kan?

1446
01:00:25,000 --> 01:00:27,000
 Atau jawatannya.

1447
01:00:27,000 --> 01:00:29,000
 Dak terdak bangun terdak duduk.

1448
01:00:29,000 --> 01:00:32,000
 Nak ceritanya kemudahan.

1449
01:00:32,000 --> 01:00:35,000
 Sambil duduk ulit.

1450
01:00:36,000 --> 01:00:40,000
 Dulu kita bincang tentang salat atas kenderaan.

1451
01:00:41,000 --> 01:00:43,000
 Banyak orang bila Musafi malam.

1452
01:00:43,000 --> 01:00:46,000
 Karena Bulan Ramadha nak balik kampung.

1453
01:00:46,000 --> 01:00:48,000
 Dia tak buat terawak.

1454
01:00:48,000 --> 01:00:51,000
 Senangkan dia boleh buat atas kenderaan.

1455
01:00:51,000 --> 01:00:53,000
 Ganti dewa.

1456
01:00:53,000 --> 01:00:54,000
 Banyak.

1457
01:00:54,000 --> 01:00:57,000
 Hatar tengah daribah boleh mayang.

1458
01:00:57,000 --> 01:00:59,000
 Punggung staraik.

1459
01:00:59,000 --> 01:01:00,000
 Banyak.

1460
01:01:00,000 --> 01:01:02,000
 Tapi tengok balik depan tu.

1461
01:01:02,000 --> 01:01:04,000
 Dari rukok bula.

1462
01:01:04,000 --> 01:01:06,000
 Degung tak buat depan.

1463
01:01:06,000 --> 01:01:08,000
 Isyarat setakat boleh.

